# 저장소 맨 위: 편집기·OS 파일만. 백엔드·프론트 규칙은 각 폴더의 .gitignore에 있어요.
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# Python helper caches and private operations review notes
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
docs/reviews/

# Root-level Vercel CLI project link
.vercel/

# Local environment files anywhere (e.g. `vercel env pull` writes .env.local at the linked root). Examples stay tracked.
.env*
!.env.example
!*.example
